WEBVTT

00:24:29.871 --> 00:24:33.038
And, you know, we're seeing the
consequences of it now.

00:24:33.038 --> 00:24:34.913
So I think it cuts both ways.

00:24:35.496 --> 00:24:39.079
I'm and part of the reason why I'm so
attracted to film as an art form is

00:24:39.079 --> 00:24:42.121
because it does cut both ways
incredibly sharply and with

00:24:42.121 --> 00:24:43.204
an incredibly large sword.

00:24:43.579 --> 00:24:49.663
Hmm. What is one movie or book
or cultural artifact

00:24:49.663 --> 00:24:51.579
or idea that's made you a better human?

00:24:52.371 --> 00:24:58.329
I mean. Look, I'm very lucky in
that I have two parents who.

00:24:59.163 --> 00:25:01.204
Very clearly communicated to me